{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43524","headline":"三言喜皇甫侍御见过南楼玩月 · 颜真卿","name":"三言喜皇甫侍御见过南楼玩月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜嘉客，辟前轩。\n天月净，水云昏。\n雁声苦，蟾影寒。\n闻裛浥，滴檀栾。\n欢宴处，江湖间。\n卷翠幕，吟嘉句。\n恨清光，留不住。\n高驾动，清角催。\n惜归去，重裴回。\n露欲曦，客将醉。\n犹宛转，照深意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}